     putBack(window, at: frame, on: display)
+    // A hand can leave a window where nobody else can put it: asked to place one, macOS keeps its title bar above the Dock, and an app
+    // has its own mind about sizes. Where it has come to is as near as it comes, and it is still where its person pushed it. The
+    // hand's note goes with it, or the next way back would take that for a place nobody chose.
